<title>USA: America Online tops 7 mln subscribers.</title>
<headline>America Online tops 7 mln subscribers.</headline>
<dateline>DULLES, Va. 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>America Online Inc said on Wednesday that its subscriber base has grown to more than seven million subscribers worldwide.  </p>
<p>America Online reached the six million subscriber landmark on May 30, 1996, Pam McGraw, director of media relations, said.</p>
